---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import NoticeHubNav from '../../components/NoticeHubNav.astro';
---

<Base title="Notice" description="Training interoceptive awareness through AI-guided contemplative reflection.">
  <div class="hub-page">
    <NoticeHubNav current="hub" />

    <header class="notice-header">
      <div class="notice-header__eyebrow">NOTICE</div>
      <img src="/images/enso-transparent.png" alt="" class="notice-header__enso" width="60" height="60" />
      <h1 class="notice-header__title">Notice</h1>
      <p class="notice-header__subtitle"><em>Making the body's intelligence visible and navigable.</em></p>
      <p class="notice-header__desc">Training interoceptive awareness through AI-guided contemplative reflection.</p>
      <a href="https://notice.tools" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="notice-cta-btn">Sign Up for the Beta →</a>
    </header>

    <div class="builder-note reveal">
      <p>The gap between what your body knows and what you consciously register is measurable. Heart rate variability drops before anxiety arrives. Breathing shallows before you notice you're bracing. Interoceptive signals travel a dedicated neural pathway, but conscious access to those signals varies enormously — and it's trainable.</p>
      <p>Notice trains that skill. The core interaction — a Frame Snap — captures a biometric snapshot the moment you notice a shift, then pairs it with a contemplative AI reflection that orients toward <em>how you're meeting your experience</em>, not what the experience supposedly is. Over time, the system measures what I'm calling <strong>interoceptive lead time</strong>: the temporal gap between when your body shifts and when you consciously register it. Shrinking that gap <em>is</em> interoceptive development. As far as I can tell, no one else is measuring it.</p>
      <p>The app is designed to get quieter as you get better — <strong>scaffolding decay</strong>, the deliberate reduction of AI support as independent capacity grows. The value isn't in screen time captured. It's in the skill built.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid card-grid--top">

      <a class="notice-card reveal" href="/notice/vision/" style="transition-delay: 0ms">
        <div class="card-eyebrow">VISION</div>
        <h2 class="card-title">The Body Knows First</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">The full vision — what Notice is, why it exists, and where it's going. The science, the architecture, the market.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="notice-card reveal" href="/writing/notice/" style="transition-delay: 100ms">
        <div class="card-eyebrow">THE BUILD</div>
        <h2 class="card-title">24 Hours to a Working Product</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">From zero Swift experience to a live beta — the design-first development process, three iterative loops, and what agentic AI actually changes about shipping.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="notice-card reveal" href="/notice/roadmap/" style="transition-delay: 200ms">
        <div class="card-eyebrow">ROADMAP</div>
        <h2 class="card-title">What's Next</h2>
        <p class="card-desc">What's shipped, what's in progress, and where Notice is headed. A living document.</p>
      </a>

    </div>

    <div class="card-section-label">FOR INVESTORS</div>

    <div class="card-grid card-grid--bottom">

      <div class="notice-card notice-card--compound reveal" style="transition-delay: 0ms">
        <a class="card-main-link" href="/notice/deck/">
          <div class="card-eyebrow">INVESTOR DECK</div>
          <h2 class="card-title">The Pitch</h2>
          <p class="card-desc">Eight slides. The insight, the product, the metric no one else measures, the moat.</p>
        </a>
        <div class="card-pdf-link">
          <a href="/notice-investor-deck-v2.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF version ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="notice-card notice-card--compound reveal" style="transition-delay: 100ms">
        <a class="card-main-link" href="/notice/brief/">
          <div class="card-eyebrow">INVESTOR BRIEF</div>
          <h2 class="card-title">The One-Pager</h2>
          <p class="card-desc">Everything distilled. The insight, the product, the metric, the moat — with interactive diagrams.</p>
        </a>
        <div class="card-pdf-link">
          <a href="/notice-investor-brief.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF version ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <footer class="notice-footer">
      <p>If this resonates — as a user, investor, or collaborator — reach out.</p>
      <div class="notice-footer__links">
        <a href="https://notice.tools" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="notice-cta-btn">Sign Up for the Beta →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="notice-footer__links" style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
        <a href="mailto:thbrdy@pando.industries">thbrdy@pando.industries</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  /* ── Hub Page Layout ── */
  .hub-page {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 60px;
  }

  /* ── Header ── */
  .notice-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 4rem auto 0;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .notice-header__eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .notice-header__enso {
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .notice-header__title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .notice-header__subtitle {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .notice-header__desc {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-mid);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── Builder's Note ── */
  .builder-note {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 2.5rem auto 0;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-mid);
  }

  .builder-note p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .builder-note p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .builder-note strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  /* ── Card Grid ── */
  .card-grid {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .card-grid--top {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .card-grid--bottom {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .card-section-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 2.5rem auto 0.75rem;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  /* ── Cards ── */
  .notice-card {
    display: block;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .notice-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .notice-card--compound {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .notice-card--compound:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px var(--accent-glow);
  }

  .card-main-link {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .card-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .card-desc {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .card-pdf-link {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .card-pdf-link a {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .card-pdf-link a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* ── Scroll Reveal ── */
  .reveal {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(16px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94),
                transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94);
  }

  .reveal.revealed {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  /* ── Footer ── */
  .notice-footer {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: 3rem auto 4rem;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .notice-footer p {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-light);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .notice-footer__links a {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .notice-footer__links a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  /* ── CTA Button ── */
  .notice-cta-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .notice-cta-btn:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
  }

  /* ── Reduced Motion ── */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .reveal {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }
    .notice-card {
      transition: none;
    }
    .notice-card--compound {
      transition: none;
    }
  }

  /* ── Responsive: Tablet ── */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hub-page {
      padding-top: 50px;
    }
  }

  /* ── Responsive: Phone ── */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .card-grid--top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .card-grid--bottom {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .notice-header {
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
  const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');

  if (prefersReducedMotion) {
    revealElements.forEach(el => el.classList.add('revealed'));
  } else {
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          (entry.target as HTMLElement).classList.add('revealed');
          observer.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.15 });
    revealElements.forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
  }
</script>
